{"title":"Career Roadmap · Destination Marketer","role":"Destination Marketer","summary":"A Destination Marketer promotes a city, state, country, region or tourism destination to attract visitors and increase tourism-related economic activity.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Tourism & Hospitality Studies"},"about":[{"label":"Degree Alignment","text":"Excellent"},{"label":"Primary Sectors","text":"Tourism Boards, Destination Management Organisations, Hotels, Airlines, Travel Companies, OTAs, Events, Hospitality Brands"},{"label":"Typical Entry Roles","text":"Destination Marketing Executive, Tourism Marketing Executive, Travel Marketing Associate, Digital Marketing Executive"},{"label":"Long-Term Roles","text":"Destination Marketing Manager → Senior Manager → Head of Destination Marketing → Tourism Marketing Director"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Destination Marketer promotes a city, state, country, region or tourism destination to attract visitors and increase tourism-related economic activity."},{"type":"h","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"Digital media"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Travel trends"},{"text":"Content creation"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Partnerships"},{"text":"Public relations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BA in Tourism & Hospitality Studies, this is a highly relevant career."},{"type":"p","text":"A destination marketer may promote a destination to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Domestic tourists"},{"text":"International tourists"},{"text":"Families"},{"text":"Luxury travellers"},{"text":"Adventure travellers"},{"text":"Business travellers"},{"text":"MICE travellers"},{"text":"Film tourism audiences"},{"text":"Cultural tourists"},{"text":"Wellness travellers"},{"text":"Eco-tourists"}]},{"t