cutive, Digital Marketing Executive"}],[{"text":"1–4 years"},{"text":"Destination Marketing Associate, Tourism Marketing Specialist"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Destination Marketing Manager, Tourism Campaign Manager"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Destination Marketing Manager, Tourism Brand Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Head of Destination Marketing, Tourism Marketing Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Tourism + Marketing Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism geography"},{"text":"Hospitality"},{"text":"Travel management"},{"text":"Tourism economics"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Cultural heritage"},{"text":"Tourism policy"},{"text":"Sustainable tourism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"STP — Segmentation, Targeting, Positioning"},{"text":"Marketing mix"},{"text":"Brand positioning"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Consumer research"},{"text":"Campaign planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"First project"},{"type":"h","text":"Destination Marketing Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Choose a destination such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hyderabad"},{"text":"Kerala"},{"text":"Rajasthan"},{"text":"Goa"},{"text":"Northeast India"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Dubai"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target tourists"},{"text":"Existing branding"},{"text":"Attractions"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Website"},{"text":"Search visibility"},{"text":"Tourism campaigns"},{"text":"Visitor experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"End with:"},{"type":"p","text":"10 recommendations to improve destination marketing."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Digital Marketing & Content","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Destination marketing is increasingly digital."},{"type":"h","t