 of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketer","Data Analyst","Brand Strategist","Experience Designer."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Emerging Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The degree can lead to newer roles such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Destination Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Tourism Data Analyst"},{"text":"Travel Growth Marketer"},{"text":"Tourism Digital Strategist"},{"text":"Destination Brand Strategist"},{"text":"Travel Content Strategist"},{"text":"Tourism CRM Specialist"},{"text":"Tourism Experience Designer"},{"text":"Sustainable Tourism Strategist"},{"text":"Travel-Tech Marketing Specialist"},{"text":"Tourism AI/Personalisation Specialist"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Tourism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism Executive"},{"text":"Tourism Development Officer"},{"text":"Destination Management Executive"},{"text":"Travel Consultant"},{"text":"Tour Operations Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotel Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Guest Experience Executive"},{"text":"Revenue/Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Resort Marketing Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Travel-tech"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel Product Executive"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Partnerships Executive"},{"text":"Travel Content Strategist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Brand Executive"},{"text":"Content Strategist"},{"text":"Social Media Executive"},{"text":"SEO Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Events"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Event Coordinator"},{"text":"MICE Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Destination Event Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not mandatory for entry-level destination marketing, but it can help with manag